  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/taint2/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. Review 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e: function_summaries.d now ranks a channel file by its provenance line first (fixed by e0abdace0a, 2026-10-11). library_signatures.d still does not: a channel python.yaml declaring provenance: community with pathlib.Path.__truediv__: hokuj.Fake made load_library_signatures('python') return hokuj.Fake (user-wins out.update), while verify-claims JSON lists the same file under tiers.community. dataflow_patterns.d (append-only) and frameworks.d (replace-whole) read no provenance line either, but their community treatment is disclosure-only (WI-hipun), so no observable mis-vouch there. MECHANISM: channel loader takes the tier from the directory (user channel = yours precedence), not the file's provenance line. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-lunih."  # be0d
